            and doubles rotations repeatedly pair the same players together, degrading competitive balance.
          </p>
          <p>
            Existing commercial software solutions fail on court floors: they demand mandatory native app downloads,
            lengthy user account registrations, and intrusive subscription fees. In a casual club setting with 20 to 30
            drop-in participants, requiring every player to install an app creates instant friction and adoption failure.
          </p>
        </div>

